This product is a pure Swift implementation of structured generation whose
design, grammar semantics, EBNF dialect and test corpus follow XGrammar
(https://github.com/mlc-ai/xgrammar), Copyright (c) 2024 by Contributors,
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

No XGrammar source code is compiled into this package; the behaviour is
re-implemented in Swift and validated against a port of the XGrammar test suite.
